     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet naloxone-medications</b></p><a name=\"naloxone-medications\"> </a><a name=\"hcnaloxone-medications\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profiles: <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/cpg/STU1/StructureDefinition-cpg-computablevalueset.html\">CPGComputableValueSet</a>, <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/cpg/STU1/StructureDefinition-cpg-executablevalueset.html\">CPGExecutableValueSet</a></p></div><p style=\"border: black 1px dotted; background-color: #EEEEEE; padding: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px\">Expansion based on codesystem RxNorm version 03022026</p><p>This value set contains 50 concepts</p><table class=\"codes\"><tr><td><b>System</b></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td><a name=\"naloxone-medications-http://www.nlm.nih.gov/research/umls/rxnorm-1010603\"> </a><code>http://www.nlm.nih.gov/research/umls/rxnorm</code></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  1010603</td><td>buprenorphine 2 MG / naloxone 0.5 MG Sublingual Film [Suboxone]</td></tr><tr><td><a name=\"naloxone-medications-http://www.nlm.nih.gov/research/umls/rxnorm-1010606\"> </a><code>http://www.nlm.nih.gov/research/umls/rxnorm</code></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  1010606</td><td>buprenorphine 8 MG / naloxone 2 MG Sublingual Film [Suboxone]</td></tr><tr><td><a name=\"naloxone-medications-http://www.nlm.nih.gov/research/umls/rxnorm-1307058\"> </a><code>http://www.nlm.nih.gov/research/umls/rxnorm</code></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  1307058</td><td>buprenorphine 4 MG / naloxone 1 MG Sublingual Film [Suboxone]</td></tr><tr><td><a name=\"naloxone-medications-http://www.nlm.nih.gov/research/umls/rxnorm-1307063\"> </a><code>http://www.nlm.